Dialogue: 2,0:22:39.71,0:22:46.39,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}I, I must be losing my mind
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.76,0:22:52.68,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}I keep on trying to find a way out
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.60,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}There is no need
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.60,0:22:59.36,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}you don't lock the door anymore
Dialogue: 2,0:23:02.94,0:23:09.53,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}I, you know I never go out
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.29,0:23:15.92,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}And you know I start to forget things
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.92,0:23:17.58,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}It's ok
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.58,0:23:23.01,ED-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&}they weren't essential anyway
